https://github.com/github/gh-stack/tree/main/skills/gh-stack. Reused the
existing shared vendor location rather than maintaining a second copy or
adding a network download to installation. The explicit main URL selected
the current upstream revision. Kept this logical change in a new gh-stack
layer above the shared-instructions layer, with one commit and a draft PR.

