## Findings & Constraints
The vendor policy is verbatim upstream, recorded in commit 45fd692. Upstream
now splits the former large file into SKILL.md and three references:
commands.md, stack-design.md, and troubleshooting.md. Copy the directory,
not only SKILL.md. Upstream metadata and the local plugin release version
are independent. This commit changes the skill, not the installed gh-stack
CLI extension. Installer replacement is limited to explicitly managed skills.

